    /// open, rate_limited past 10 per minute per address or 5 per window, conflict for a key this node knows. One live
    /// request per key: a new one replaces it.
    case devicePairRequest = "device.pair.request"
    /// How the request stands. Answered at once (no long poll): after pending, ask again in 2 s. Approved carries the
    /// node's id and name and the device id; the device then pins the server key and reconnects, which makes a Device
