    /// re-listing folders. Needs List on the vault root (storage.vault.accessible.list's browse). Only changes to
    /// entries the caller can Lookup are returned: a rename or move into view reads as create, out of view as delete.
    /// Without `since`: the current revision and no changes, the anchor to take before enumerating. `expired`: the
    /// cursor can't be served (retention, an authorization change that can change what the caller sees, or a revision
