    case mirrorRelinkAccept = "mirror.relink.accept"
    /// Carries the open plan out, or with keep (this | theirs) compares again and keeps that server's tree everywhere
    /// (the hard override). The chosen server becomes the vault's core in a term above any either used, the other its
    /// mirror: the mirror first brings each entry whose chosen version is its own onto the core as its own changes
    /// (contents over the sealed lane), then starts its copy over from the core's tree. Nothing is dropped: what leaves
