    /// carried out once approved (this server's follower, or this command again); with keep, each step waits as
    /// mirror.relink.compare does. Answers mirror.relink.get; follow its progress there. Super admins; the keys step-up
    /// in the console; audited mirror.relink on both servers.
    case mirrorRelinkApply = "mirror.relink.apply"
    /// Approves the outcome a linked server proposed for its relink of the vault: which server becomes the core, the
