    case mirrorRelinkApprove = "mirror.relink.approve"
    /// Compares a vault this server and a linked server both hold since a mirror between them ended (detached, the core
    /// ended it or the servers were unlinked, an old core rejoining or forked after a take over) with the other
    /// server's, by entry uid: what is only on one server, and what both hold and changed on this side, the other or
    /// both since the last position both agreed on (differs where that cannot be told). Entry hashes only: no file's
    /// contents are read. Kept as the vault's open plan (replacing an open one): every entry the default (the core's),
    /// this server the core. The first call asks the other server (relink phase requested): nothing of its tree is read
    /// until a super admin there accepts; call again once they have. Super admins.
